  "steps": [
    "In a bowl, combine 1 spoon of red pepper paste, 2 spoons of soy sauce, red pepper powder, 2 spoons of vinegar, 2 spoons of sugar, 1 spoon of sesame oil, and sesame seeds, then mix thoroughly to make the sauce.",
    "Add 1 serving of noodles to boiling water and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Rinse the cooked noodles in cold water and drain well.",
    "Add the drained noodles to the bowl with the sauce (which contains chopped kimchi) and mix thoroughly by hand.",
    "Transfer the mixed noodles to a serving bowl and garnish with boiled egg, seaweed flakes, and sesame seeds."
  ]
